  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/12/IMG_0995.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Hasta este viernes, 28 de diciembre, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Au7WKHJfyCY\" target=\"_blank\">se desarrolla la &#39;Fun week&#39; en Kids&amp;Us Onda</a>, en la plaza Corts Valencianes. Adem&aacute;s del Market,&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/12/IMG_1043.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eq_N9l9Dkgk\" target=\"_blank\">este jueves se ha llevado a cabo en La Cassola la &#39;Storytime&#39; Santa&#39;s Elves</a>.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/kidsampusfunweekstorytime18/img_0944.jpg\" alt=\"img_0944\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/kidsampusfunweekstorytime18/img_0945.jpg\" alt=\"img_0945\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/kidsampusfunweekstorytime18/img_0946.jpg\" alt=\"img_0946\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/kidsampusfunweekstorytime18/img_0948.jpg\" alt=\"img_0948\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/kidsampusfunweekstorytime18/img_0949.jpg\" alt=\"img_0949\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/kidsampusfunweekstorytime18/img_0951.jpg\" alt=\"img_0951\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/kidsampusfunweekstorytime18/img_0952.jpg\" alt=\"img_0952\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715